    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念转过身。顾深正看着她，灰色的眼睛在晨光里变成了浅棕色。他的右手食指在杯壁上画了一个圈——不是习惯动作，是在思考。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不渴。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我不渴。\"苏念说。\n\"你昨天也不渴？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian wipes the counter with a rag",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念没回答。她拿起一块抹布，擦吧台。吧台已经很干净了，但她的手需要做点什么。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深喝完咖啡，把杯子推到吧台中央。杯底在木质台面上发出一声轻响。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我查了一下。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我查了一下。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你说'查了'什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的抹布停了。\n\"你说'查了'什么？\"\n\"你的咖啡店。\"顾深的语速比平时更慢，每个字都像在称重。\"'念想'，2019年注册，法人是你的外婆苏兰芝。2023年她"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian picks up the phone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他从口袋里拿出手机，打开一个页面，屏幕朝苏念倾斜了一下。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "grandmother",
    "action_visual": "grandmother gazes at the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "这是你外婆的旧照片。我在老城区的社区档案里找到的。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "grandmother",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"这是你外婆的旧照片。我在老城区的社区档案里找到的。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the phone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念没看手机。她看着顾深的手——他的手指在屏幕上点了一下，照片放大了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你看。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你看。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian picks up the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念走过去。手机屏幕上是一张黑白照片：一个年轻女人站在咖啡店门口，手里拿着一块木牌。木牌上写着两个字——\"念想\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "这照片——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "但女人的脸是模糊的。不是照片质量差，是脸的部分像是被人用橡皮擦过，只剩下一个轮廓。\n苏念的手指在照片上方停住了。\n\"这照片——\"她的声音有点哑，\"为什么脸是模糊"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly the phone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我也不知道。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我也不知道。\"顾深收回手机，\"原版照片就是这样。档案室的人说，这张照片洗出来的时候就是这样的。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的左耳又开始嗡鸣了。这次更轻，像是有人在很远的地方吹口哨。\n她用手捂住耳朵。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你不舒服？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你不舒服？\"顾深站起来。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian places down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "没事。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"没事。\"苏念放下手，\"老毛病。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 31,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深看着她。他的表情像是在做一道数学题——每一步都精确，但答案怎么都凑不齐。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 32,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"苏念。\"他说。\n\"嗯。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 33,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你每次喝完我的咖啡，都会出现这种表情。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你每次喝完我的咖啡，都会出现这种表情。\"他的声音很轻，但每个字都清晰，\"不是'不舒服'——是'听到了什么'。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 34,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the rag",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的抹布从手里滑落，掉在地上。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 35,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你在听什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她弯腰去捡。站起来的时候，顾深已经走到了吧台这边。他离她很近——近到她能看到他衬衫领口上有一个很小的咖啡渍。\n\"你在听什么？\"他问。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 36,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念抬头看着他。他的灰色眼睛里没有质问，只有困惑。像一个解不开方程式的数学家。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 37,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不知道你在说什么。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我不知道你在说什么。\"苏念说。\n\"你知道。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 38,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
